            "review_title": "Review at Ting Toong Coffee Shop",
            "review_text": "QuanEcko\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam2 contributions\n0\nWant to tell your story? Come here.\nApr 2018 • Friends\nI met the owner of this place 3 year ago in Bangkok, we've never think about coffee shop ever ultil she was planning this and now she had her own small place and tell me in my surprise. \nI love the design made by small windows, it reminds me my parent's room in Vietnam. \nWhenever my friends get bored or need some advices, I ask them come to Ting toong, have a coffee and talk with the boss. They did and go back to me, tell me how interesting they were to hear the stories from Binh and her passionate. \nDefinitely, I will visit this shop when I come back to Vietnam.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten July 16, 2018",
